{
  "file_id": "ID03571",
  "text_count": 209,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "So defeating Vamdemon wasn't\nenough?",
      "_offset": 2787,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "No way... so we'll still be\ntrapped here in the fog?",
      "_offset": 2824,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "An email? It's from Gennai.",
      "_offset": 2877,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Rejoice, Chosen Children! I found\na hint about how to defeat\nVamdemon!",
      "_offset": 2905,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "I found a poem in some ancient\nruins, with a prophecy.",
      "_offset": 2976,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "A flock of bats blotted out the\nsun.",
      "_offset": 3031,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "The masses chanted the name of the\nundead Digimon king.",
      "_offset": 3068,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "When the clock struck the number\nof the beast, the undead Digimon\nking revealed himself.",
      "_offset": 3124,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "The angels shot arrows of hope and\nlight into the loved ones of those\nthey were summoned to protect...",
      "_offset": 3213,
      "_length": 102,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "and a miracle happened. Anyway, I\nwish you luck.",
      "_offset": 3316,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "He said it was a hint, but it's\njust a load of gibberish. Doesn't\nhe know how to clear up this fog?",
      "_offset": 3365,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 3465,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Taichi, we should find Mom and Dad\nright now.",
      "_offset": 3473,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Let's get out of here for now...",
      "_offset": 3519,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Mom! Open your eyes!",
      "_offset": 3552,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "You too, Dad!",
      "_offset": 3573,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Mom!",
      "_offset": 3587,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Papa! Mama!",
      "_offset": 3592,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I thought we'd only have to deal\nwith the fog, but now this...",
      "_offset": 3604,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Their pulses are normal.",
      "_offset": 3667,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Are you Jou's brother?",
      "_offset": 3692,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Yeah, the Bakemon didn't find him\nbecause he was hiding in a closet.",
      "_offset": 3715,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Are you a doctor?",
      "_offset": 3784,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'm still in medical school. But\nthere's no time for chit-chat, we \nneed to take care of these people.",
      "_offset": 3802,
      "_length": 102,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "It's my fault, isn't it...",
      "_offset": 3905,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "It's my fault, too...",
      "_offset": 3932,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's okay. They're just sleeping.",
      "_offset": 3954,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "If you give them time, they'll\nwake up, right? Mom...",
      "_offset": 3988,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "What did you want to talk with me\nabout?",
      "_offset": 4042,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "While we were hiding from the\nmonsters, your mom and I discussed\nthis, and we decided to tell you,",
      "_offset": 4083,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "The truth is, we're not your real\nparents.",
      "_offset": 4182,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "I already knew.",
      "_offset": 4225,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I pretended I hadn't heard and\ntried to act the same as I had\nbefore.",
      "_offset": 4241,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "But in the end, I couldn't do it.\nSo I got absorbed in my computer\nto hide my true self.",
      "_offset": 4311,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "It's fine to be interested in\ncomputers!",
      "_offset": 4400,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Dad...",
      "_offset": 4441,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "It's fine for you to have your own\ninterests... but you really are\nexactly like your real father.",
      "_offset": 4448,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "My real father?",
      "_offset": 4546,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "He was a distant relative and a\ngenius mathematician.",
      "_offset": 4562,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 4616,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "We were planning to tell you when\nyou grew up, but... I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 4624,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Thank you for telling me the\ntruth.",
      "_offset": 4689,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Ah, I mean... t-thanks.",
      "_offset": 4725,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "You don't have to force yourself.",
      "_offset": 4749,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yes, all we want for you is to be\nhappy. We don't need any more than\nthat.",
      "_offset": 4783,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Koushirou, just let those tears\nout! Don't worry 'bout havin' it\nall to yourself!",
      "_offset": 4858,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "What's with all those bats?!",
      "_offset": 4940,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "They're covering the sky! And the\nsun!",
      "_offset": 4969,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "\"A flock of bats blotted out the\nsun...\"",
      "_offset": 5008,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Heh heh heh. The true moment of\nterror is about to begin!",
      "_offset": 5049,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Sora! Your mom!",
      "_offset": 5107,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "_offset": 5123,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "_offset": 5129,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What's wrong, Mom? Mom!",
      "_offset": 5149,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "_offset": 5173,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "_offset": 5193,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Stop it, Dad!",
      "_offset": 5213,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Papa! Mama!",
      "_offset": 5227,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "W-what's..",
      "_offset": 5239,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Um, there's something bothering\nme.",
      "_offset": 5250,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "The prophecy, right? \"The masses\nchanted the name of the undead\nDigimon king.\"",
      "_offset": 5286,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "We saw bats, too. Just like the\nprophecy said.",
      "_offset": 5365,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 5412,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "What was the third part of the\nprophecy?",
      "_offset": 5419,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "\"When the clock struck the number\nof the beast, the undead Digimon\nking revealed himself...\"",
      "_offset": 5460,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "What's the \"number of the beast\"?",
      "_offset": 5553,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "666. A number from the Book of\nRevelation.",
      "_offset": 5587,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "666 would be... 6:06 and 6\nseconds? In that case, it's almost\ntime!",
      "_offset": 5630,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Is that... Vamdemon?",
      "_offset": 5698,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "But he's so big...",
      "_offset": 5719,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Hahaha, looks like you're\nspeechless in front of Lord\nVenomVamdemon's form.",
      "_offset": 5738,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "VenomVamdemon?!",
      "_offset": 5814,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Power... I need more power.",
      "_offset": 5830,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "If you need food, I've secured it.\nCome, I'll lead you there!",
      "_offset": 5858,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "You're first!",
      "_offset": 5920,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "W-What are you doing?!\nAaaaaaaargh!",
      "_offset": 5934,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "We won't let you eat everyone!",
      "_offset": 5970,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "We have to do something about\nthis!",
      "_offset": 6001,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Garurumon!",
      "_offset": 6037,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Got it, Yamato!",
      "_offset": 6048,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 6064,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Nothing's working!",
      "_offset": 6074,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Aaaaaaargh!",
      "_offset": 6093,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Gaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 6105,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Agumon!",
      "_offset": 6117,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Gabumon! What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 6125,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "O powers of evil!",
      "_offset": 6152,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "We'll destroy you once again!",
      "_offset": 6170,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Haha... Hahahahahaha! You're\nsaying you're gonna destroy me?",
      "_offset": 6200,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Is that monster supposed to be a\nPerfect-level Digimon?",
      "_offset": 6261,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "I'll look into it!",
      "_offset": 6317,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Ultimate level?!",
      "_offset": 6336,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "There's a level above Perfect?!",
      "_offset": 6353,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Your attacks won't do anything!",
      "_offset": 6385,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Hang in there, Angemon!",
      "_offset": 6417,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Angewomon!",
      "_offset": 6441,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "That's it! The rest of the\nprophecy!",
      "_offset": 6452,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "If Angemon and Angewomon are the\n\"angels\"...",
      "_offset": 6489,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "then who are \"those they were\nsummoned to protect\"?",
      "_offset": 6534,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Takeru and Hikari! Now as for\n\"their loved ones\"...",
      "_offset": 6586,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "I'll do the explainin'. If I were\nan angel...",
      "_offset": 6638,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "...the person I'm protectin' would\nbe Koushirou.",
      "_offset": 6684,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "The people I love the most are my\nmom and dad. So Hikari and\nTakeru's loved ones...",
      "_offset": 6733,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Their family! Their parents and\nsiblings.",
      "_offset": 6817,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "But why do we have to shoot arrows\ninto their loved ones?",
      "_offset": 6859,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Well, Cupid fires arrows of love!",
      "_offset": 6917,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Right-o! Angemon and Angewomon can\nlet loose their arrows o' love.",
      "_offset": 6951,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "What do you think?",
      "_offset": 7018,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "That must be it!",
      "_offset": 7037,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "But if we do that...",
      "_offset": 7054,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "You and Taichi might die.",
      "_offset": 7075,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "We won't die!",
      "_offset": 7101,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 7115,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Then we'll use my light!",
      "_offset": 7121,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
